						 <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Spoilers</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Now&nbsp;you&nbsp;know~</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>“No! I must kill the monstrosities!” he shouted<br /> The radio said “No, Researcher. You are the <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-682">SCP-682</a>”<br /> And then Researcher was a hard-to-destroy reptile.</p> </div> </div> </div> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
